11
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:35,840
(Yak Finish-the-Line Challenge)
Two teams of four face off.

12
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:37,080
They take turns playing.

13
00:00:37,080 --> 00:00:39,600
Each round, two act and two guess.

14
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:41,040
The actors are given

15
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:43,320
an everyday expression.

16
00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:45,480
They act out a scene

17
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:46,720
to get their teammates

18
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:49,080
to guess the exact phrase.

19
00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:51,280
The other team can steal at any time.

20
00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:54,000
A successful steal means no points
for the actors.

21
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:55,320
Each team has ten minutes.

22
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:56,600
Let's give it a try.

23
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:58,760
Team Bai goes first.

24
00:00:58,860 --> 00:01:00,620
(Acting, Guessing)

25
00:01:00,920 --> 00:01:03,480
I feel like the chemistry
Bai and I had last episode

26
00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:05,160
has kind of faded.

27
00:01:05,160 --> 00:01:06,560
Should I give you two

28
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:08,480
(Should I leave?)
some space?

29
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,280
(No need)
We've talked plenty off-camera.

30
00:01:10,280 --> 00:01:12,200
We've already hashed it out.
So, let's go.

31
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:13,560
This is our comeback round. Come on.

32
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:13,960
Let's go.

33
00:01:13,960 --> 00:01:14,600
(YuTing Clear Skies:
The Chemistry Showdown)

34
00:01:14,600 --> 00:01:15,200
Come on.

35
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:16,740
(Clue: "Chou ya tou")
[*You rotten little girl]

36
00:01:16,740 --> 00:01:18,760
(You rotten little girl)

37
