56
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:47,760
You spoiled brat.

57
00:01:47,760 --> 00:01:48,520
A girl.

58
00:01:48,520 --> 00:01:49,080
You...

59
00:01:49,920 --> 00:01:50,880
You bad girl.

60
00:01:50,880 --> 00:01:52,280
We're from up north.

61
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:54,060
(Adding some context)
A northern family.

62
00:01:54,640 --> 00:01:55,600
You little rascal.

63
00:01:55,600 --> 00:01:56,640
A girl.

64
00:01:56,640 --> 00:01:57,260
