66
00:01:58,580 --> 00:02:00,020
(So close)

67
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:00,840
You darn little girl.

68
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:01,340
(Darn little girl.)

69
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:02,760
Quick.

70
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:04,600
You got the "girl" part.

71
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:05,160
(Brain working overtime)

72
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:05,920
You rotten little girl.

73
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:10,240
That was close.

74
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:10,960
Wait a second.

75
00:02:10,960 --> 00:02:12,640
