79
00:02:18,260 --> 00:02:19,020
(Clue: "Ni neng lai jie wo ma")
[*Can you come pick me up?]

80
00:02:19,020 --> 00:02:20,260
(What? This one's tricky)

81
00:02:20,260 --> 00:02:25,140
(Can you come pick me up?)

82
00:02:25,140 --> 00:02:26,060
