90
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:45,000
I'm a little busy right now.

91
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:46,480
Can't you just call a taxi?

92
00:02:46,480 --> 00:02:47,400
Can you pick me up?

93
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:49,920
You're really close.

94
00:02:49,920 --> 00:02:51,480
