95
00:02:51,480 --> 00:02:52,600
Hurry up and pick me up.

96
00:02:53,040 --> 00:02:54,240
Come over and get me.

97
00:02:54,880 --> 00:02:55,600
It's a...

98
00:02:57,160 --> 00:02:57,760
