185
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:18,160
Need you.

186
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:19,080
Need you here.

187
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:19,880
Can't live without you.

188
00:05:19,880 --> 00:05:20,800
Super close.

189
00:05:21,440 --> 00:05:22,040
I can't do it without you.

190
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:26,040
