191
00:05:26,700 --> 00:05:27,440
(Clue: "Ni gai xi tou le")
[*You need to wash your hair]

192
00:05:27,440 --> 00:05:29,040
You say it, I'll act. You say it.

193
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:30,800
